---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
interface Props {lang:"en"|"pt-br";}
const {lang}=Astro.props;
const pt=lang==="pt-br",prefix=pt?"/pt-br":"";
---
<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={(pt?"Calculadora de fabricação":"Crafting calculator")+" | Atlantica Knowledge Hub"}
 alternatePaths={{en:"/tools/crafting/","pt-br":"/pt-br/tools/crafting/"}}>
 <main id="wiki-craft-planner" class="craft-planner" data-lang={lang}>
  <nav><a href={prefix+"/tools/"}>{pt?"← Ferramentas":"← Tools"}</a></nav>
  <p class="eyebrow">ATLANTICA GLOBAL / NA · ITEMTYPE SOURCE</p>
  <h1>{pt?"Calculadora de fabricação":"Crafting calculator"}</h1>
  <p>{pt
    ?"Calcule materiais de fabricação e dependências em múltiplos níveis usando receitas extraídas do cliente. Para equipamentos, usamos a regra confirmada: batch de 1, máximo de 20 por operação. Para outros itens, utilizamos o campo Unit do cliente ou um valor informado manualmente."
    :"Plan ingredient requirements across multiple recipe levels using extracted client recipes. Equipment uses the confirmed gameplay rule: batch size 1, maximum 20 per operation. Other items use original client Unit values or explicit manual inputs."}</p>
  <form id="craft-plan-form" class="craft-form">
   <div class="field"><label for="craft-search">{pt?"Nome do item ou ItemID":"Item name or ItemID"}</label>
    <input id="craft-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" required placeholder={pt?"Digite para encontrar um item":"Start typing to find an item"} aria-controls="craft-suggestions"/>
    <ul id="craft-suggestions" aria-label={pt?"Sugestões de itens":"Item suggestions"}></ul>
   </div>
   <div class="field"><label for="craft-quantity">{pt?"Quantidade desejada":"Desired output"}</label>
    <input id="craft-quantity" type="number" min="1" max="1000000000000" value="1" step="1" required/>
   </div>
   <button type="submit">{pt?"Calcular materiais":"Calculate materials"}</button>
  </form>
  <p id="craft-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
   {pt?"Selecione um item para começar.":"Select an item to begin."}
  </p>
  <section id="craft-result" hidden>
   <h2>{pt?"Plano de produção":"Production plan"}</h2>
   <p id="craft-result-note"></p>
   <div id="craft-overview" class="craft-overview" aria-live="polite">
    <div><span>{pt?"Quantidade planejada":"Planned output"}</span><strong id="craft-summary-output">—</strong></div>
    <div><span>{pt?"Batches totais":"Total batches"}</span><strong id="craft-summary-batches">—</strong></div>
    <div><span>{pt?"Operações totais":"Total operations"}</span><strong id="craft-summary-operations">—</strong></div>
    <div><span>{pt?"Materiais para comprar":"Shopping list items"}</span><strong id="craft-summary-materials">—</strong></div>
   </div>
   <section class="craft-tree-panel">
    <div class="craft-section-heading">
     <h3>{pt?"Árvore de receitas":"Crafting tree"}</h3>
     <div class="craft-tree-tools">
      <button type="button" id="craft-tree-expand">{pt?"Expandir tudo":"Expand all"}</button>
      <button type="button" id="craft-tree-collapse">{pt?"Recolher tudo":"Collapse all"}</button>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p class="craft-muted">{pt
     ?"Os valores totais são consolidados por ItemID; itens compartilhados aparecem referenciados nas outras ramificações, sem duplicar os cálculos. Escolha Comprar/Fabricar para cada intermediário."
     :"Totals are combined by ItemID. Shared materials are referenced under additional branches without double-counting. Choose Buy/Craft for intermediate items."}</p>
    <div id="craft-tree" class="craft-tree" aria-label={pt?"Dependências de fabricação":"Crafting dependencies"}></div>
   </section>
   <div class="craft-result-grid">
    <div><h3>{pt?"Agenda de fabricação":"Craft schedule"}</h3>
      <div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr>
       <th>{pt?"Produto":"Product"}</th><th>{pt?"Necessário":"Required"}</th>
       <th>{pt?"Produzido":"Planned"}</th><th>{pt?"Batches":"Batches"}</th>
       <th>{pt?"Operações":"Operations"}</th><th>{pt?"Limite/op.":"Limit/op."}</th>
      </tr></thead><tbody id="craft-steps"></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <div><div class="craft-section-heading"><h3>{pt?"Lista de compras":"Shopping list"}</h3><div class="craft-tree-tools"><button type="button" id="craft-copy-shopping">{pt?"Copiar lista":"Copy list"}</button><button type="button" id="craft-export-shopping">{pt?"Exportar CSV":"Export CSV"}</button></div></div>
      <div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr>
       <th>{pt?"Material":"Material"}</th><th>{pt?"Quantidade":"Quantity"}</th>
       <th>{pt?"Preço unitário":"Unit price"}</th><th>{pt?"Custo":"Cost"}</th>
      </tr></thead><tbody id="craft-leaves"></tbody></table></div>
      <p id="craft-cost-total"></p>
    </div>
   </div>
   <section id="craft-surplus-section" class="craft-surplus-section" hidden><h3>{pt?"Excedentes por batch":"Batch leftovers"}</h3><ul id="craft-surplus"></ul></section>
   <div id="craft-issues" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </section>
  <p class="craft-disclaimer">{pt
   ?"Os arquivos ItemType*.ndt podem conter receitas desativadas ou variantes históricas. A calculadora não inventa receitas, tamanhos de batch nem preços de mercado. Equipamentos usam batch 1 e máximo 20 por operação; outros itens usam limite de 10.000. Esses limites são regras informadas pelo jogador, não valores extraídos automaticamente."
   :"ItemType*.ndt files can contain historical or disabled recipes. No missing recipes, batch sizes or market prices are guessed. Equipment uses batch 1 and a maximum of 20 per operation; other items retain the 10,000 limit. These are player-confirmed gameplay rules, not automatically extracted source values."}</p>
 </main>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
 import {buildClientRecipeViews} from "../data/client-craft-recipe-views.mjs";
 import {planClientCrafting,priceCraftLeaves} from "../data/client-crafting-planner.mjs";
 const root=document.getElementById("wiki-craft-planner");
 if(root){
  const pt=root.dataset.lang==="pt-br",prefix=pt?"/pt-br":"";
  const $=(id:string)=>document.getElementById(id)!;
  const query=$("craft-search") as HTMLInputElement;
  const amount=$("craft-quantity") as HTMLInputElement;
  const form=$("craft-plan-form") as HTMLFormElement;
  const suggestions=$("craft-suggestions"),status=$("craft-status");
  const result=$("craft-result"),note=$("craft-result-note");
  const steps=$("craft-steps"),leaves=$("craft-leaves"),issues=$("craft-issues");
  const cost=$("craft-cost-total");
  const treeContainer=$("craft-tree"),surplus=$("craft-surplus"),surplusSection=$("craft-surplus-section");
  const itemCategories:Record<string,string>=Object.create(null),buyIds=new Set<string>();
  const nf=new Intl.NumberFormat(pt?"pt-BR":"en-US");
  const fmt=(n:string|number)=>nf.format(BigInt(n));
  const choices:Record<string,number>={},batchOverrides:Record<string,string>={};
  const prices:Record<string,string>={};
  const storedPriceKey="atlantica.crafting.prices.v1";
  try{
   const stored=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(storedPriceKey)||"{}");
   if(stored&&typeof stored==="object"&&!Array.isArray(stored)){
    for(const [id,value] of Object.entries(stored))
     if(/^[1-9]\d{0,12}$/.test(id)&&/^\d{1,20}$/.test(String(value)))
      prices[id]=String(value);
   }
  }catch{ /* Local price persistence is optional. */ }
  const detailCache=new Map<number,Promise<any>>();
  let indexPromise:Promise<Map<string,string>>|null=null;
  let selectedId="",activeGraph:Record<string,any[]>|null=null;
  let plan:any=null;
  const el=(tag:string,value?:string)=>{
   const n=document.createElement(tag);if(value!==undefined)n.textContent=value;return n;
  };
  const itemLink=(id:string,title:string)=>{
   const a=el("a",title) as HTMLAnchorElement;
   a.href=prefix+"/items/database/?id="+encodeURIComponent(id);return a;
  };
  const fetchJSON=async(path:string)=>{
   const r=await fetch(path,{cache:"force-cache"});
   if(!r.ok)throw Error("Missing original item source");
   return r.json();
  };
  async function getIndex(){
   if(indexPromise)return indexPromise;
   indexPromise=(async()=>{
    const manifest=await fetchJSON("/data/client-items/manifest.json");
    if(manifest.snapshotId!==1||manifest.totalIds!==23586||manifest.namedIds!==22702||
       !Array.isArray(manifest.indexShards)||manifest.indexShards.length!==6)throw Error("Index mismatch");
    const shards=await Promise.all(manifest.indexShards.map((file:string)=>{
     if(!/^index-\d{2}\.json$/.test(file))throw Error("Unsafe item path");
     return fetchJSON("/data/client-items/"+file);
    }));
    const names=new Map<string,string>();
    for(const shard of shards){
     if(shard.snapshotId!==1||!Array.isArray(shard.rows))throw Error("Index shard mismatch");
     for(const row of shard.rows)if(row[6]==="named"){
      names.set(row[0],row[1]);
      if(typeof row[2]==="string")itemCategories[row[0]]=row[2];
     }
    }
    if(names.size!==22702)throw Error("Incomplete source name index");
    return names;
   })().catch(error=>{indexPromise=null;throw error;});
   return indexPromise;
  }
  async function getDetails(id:string){
   const bucket=Math.floor(Number(id)/1000);
   if(!Number.isSafeInteger(bucket)||bucket<0||bucket>=30)return null;
   if(!detailCache.has(bucket)){
    const filename=String(bucket).padStart(2,"0")+".json";
    detailCache.set(bucket,fetchJSON("/data/client-items/details/"+filename).then(d=>{
     if(d.snapshotId!==1||d.bucket!==bucket||!d.items)throw Error("Detail shard mismatch");
     return d.items;
    }).catch(e=>{detailCache.delete(bucket);throw e;}));
   }
   return (await detailCache.get(bucket))?.[id]??null;
  }
  let suggestTicket=0;
  async function suggest(){
   const ticket=++suggestTicket;
   selectedId="";activeGraph=null;suggestions.replaceChildren();
   const text=query.value.trim().toLowerCase();
   if(text.length<2)return;
   try{
    const names=await getIndex();
    if(ticket!==suggestTicket)return;
    const matches=[...names].filter(([id,name])=>id===text||
     name.toLowerCase().includes(text)).slice(0,18);
    for(const [id,name] of matches){
     const li=el("li"),button=el("button",name+" (#"+id+")") as HTMLButtonElement;
     button.type="button";button.addEventListener("click",()=>{
      selectedId=id;query.value=name+" (#"+id+")";suggestions.replaceChildren();
     });
     li.append(button);suggestions.append(li);
    }
   }catch{status.textContent=pt?"Falha ao consultar índice de itens.":"Could not load the item index.";}
  }
  let debounce:ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>|null=null;
  query.addEventListener("input",()=>{
   if(debounce!==null)clearTimeout(debounce);
   debounce=setTimeout(()=>{void suggest();},170);
  });
  async function loadGraph(id:string){
   const names=await getIndex();
   const graph:Record<string,any[]>={};
   const seen=new Set<string>(),stack=[id];
   while(stack.length){
    const current=stack.pop()!;
    if(seen.has(current))continue;
    if(seen.size>=250)throw Error("Recipe graph exceeds 250 IDs");
    seen.add(current);
    const detail=names.has(current)?await getDetails(current):null;
    const variants=detail?buildClientRecipeViews(detail.s):[];
    graph[current]=variants;
    for(const recipe of variants)
     for(const [materialId] of recipe.materials)
      if(!seen.has(materialId))stack.push(materialId);
   }
   return graph;
  }
  function refreshCosts(){
   if(!plan)return;
   const priced=priceCraftLeaves(plan.leaves,prices);
   for(const row of priced.rows){
    const cell=leaves.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-cost-for="'+row.itemId+'"]');
    if(cell)cell.textContent=row.total===null?"—":fmt(row.total);
   }
   cost.textContent=(priced.complete
    ?(pt?"Custo total: ":"Total cost: ")
    :(pt?"Custo conhecido (parcial): ":"Known cost (partial): "))+fmt(priced.knownTotal)+
    (priced.unpricedItems?" · "+priced.unpricedItems+
     (pt?" materiais sem preço":" materials without prices"):"");
  }
  function renderCraftTree(){
   if(!plan)return;
   const parents:{depth:number;holder:HTMLElement}[]=[];
   const title=(id:string)=>nameCache?.get(id)??("Item #"+id);
   const tree=plan.tree as Array<any>;
   for(let i=0;i<tree.length;i++){
    const row=tree[i];
    while(parents.length&&parents[parents.length-1].depth>=row.depth)parents.pop();
    const parent=parents.length?parents[parents.length-1].holder:treeContainer;
    const hasChildren=tree[i+1]?.depth>row.depth;
    const wrapper=el(hasChildren?"details":"div");
    wrapper.className="craft-tree-node";
    if(hasChildren)(wrapper as HTMLDetailsElement).open=true;
    const line=el(hasChildren?"summary":"div");
    line.className="craft-tree-row";
    const first=el("span");first.className="craft-tree-name";
    first.append(itemLink(row.itemId,title(row.itemId)));
    if(row.sharedReference)first.append(el("small",pt?" · compartilhado":" · shared"));
    line.append(first);
    const properties=el("span");properties.className="craft-tree-numbers";
    properties.append(el("span",(pt?"Ramo: ":"Branch: ")+fmt(row.branchQuantity)));
    properties.append(el("span",(pt?"Total: ":"Total: ")+fmt(row.totalRequired)));
    if(row.output!==null){
     properties.append(el("span",(pt?"Produção: ":"Output: ")+fmt(row.output)));
     if(row.excess!=="0")properties.append(el("span",
       (pt?"Excedente: ":"Leftover: ")+fmt(row.excess)));
    }
    line.append(properties);
    const actions=el("span");actions.className="craft-tree-actions";
    if(row.itemId!==selectedId&&activeGraph?.[row.itemId]?.length){
     const purchased=buyIds.has(row.itemId);
     const toggle=el("button",purchased
      ?(pt?"Fabricar":"Craft"):(pt?"Comprar":"Buy")) as HTMLButtonElement;
     toggle.type="button";
     toggle.setAttribute("aria-label",(purchased
      ?(pt?"Fabricar ":"Craft "):(pt?"Comprar ":"Buy "))+title(row.itemId));
     toggle.addEventListener("click",event=>{
      event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();
      if(purchased)buyIds.delete(row.itemId);else buyIds.add(row.itemId);
      redraw();
     });
     actions.append(toggle);
    }
    if(row.mode==="unresolved")actions.append(el("small",pt?"Ver pendências ↓":"See questions ↓"));
    if(row.batchSource==="confirmed-equipment-rule"){
     actions.append(el("small",pt?"Equipamento · 1/batch · 20/op.":"Equipment · 1/batch · 20/op."));
    }
    line.append(actions);
    wrapper.append(line);
    parent.append(wrapper);
    if(hasChildren){
     const holder=el("div");holder.className="craft-tree-children";
     wrapper.append(holder);
     parents.push({depth:row.depth,holder});
    }
   }
  }
  function renderLeftovers(){
   if(!plan)return;
   const title=(id:string)=>nameCache?.get(id)??("Item #"+id);
   const rows=plan.leftoverRows as Array<{itemId:string;quantity:string}>;
   surplusSection.hidden=rows.length===0;
   for(const row of rows){
    const li=el("li");
    li.append(itemLink(row.itemId,title(row.itemId)),
      el("span",fmt(row.quantity)+" "+(pt?"unidades":"units")));
    surplus.append(li);
   }
  }
  $("craft-tree-expand").addEventListener("click",()=>{
   treeContainer.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>("details").forEach(d=>{d.open=true;});
  });
  $("craft-tree-collapse").addEventListener("click",()=>{
   treeContainer.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>("details").forEach(d=>{d.open=false;});
  });
  function shoppingRows(){
   if(!plan)return [];
   return priceCraftLeaves(plan.leaves,prices).rows.map(row=>({
    id:row.itemId,name:nameCache?.get(row.itemId)??("Item #"+row.itemId),
    quantity:row.quantity,unitPrice:row.unitPrice??"",cost:row.total??"",
   }));
  }
  $("craft-copy-shopping").addEventListener("click",()=>{
   const lines=shoppingRows().map(row=>
    row.name+" (#"+row.id+") · "+row.quantity+
    (row.cost?" · "+(pt?"custo ":"cost ")+row.cost:""));
   if(!lines.length)return;
   void navigator.clipboard.writeText(lines.join("\n")).then(()=>{
    status.textContent=pt?"Lista de compras copiada.":"Shopping list copied.";
   }).catch(()=>{
    status.textContent=pt?"Não foi possível copiar.":"Copy unavailable.";
   });
  });
  $("craft-export-shopping").addEventListener("click",()=>{
   const safe=(value:string)=>'"'+String(value).replace(/^([=+@-])/,"'$1")
    .replace(/"/g,'""')+'"';
   const csv=[["ItemID","Name","Quantity","UnitPrice","TotalCost"],
    ...shoppingRows().map(row=>[row.id,row.name,row.quantity,row.unitPrice,row.cost])]
    .map(row=>row.map(safe).join(",")).join("\r\n");
   const blob=new Blob(["\ufeff"+csv],{type:"text/csv;charset=utf-8"});
   const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=el("a") as HTMLAnchorElement;
   a.href=url;a.download="atlantica-craft-shopping.csv";a.click();
   setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1500);
  });
  function redraw(){
   if(!activeGraph||!selectedId)return;
   try{
    plan=planClientCrafting({itemId:selectedId,quantity:amount.value,
     recipesById:activeGraph,choices,batchOverrides,
     itemCategories,buyIds:[...buyIds]});
    steps.replaceChildren();leaves.replaceChildren();issues.replaceChildren();
    treeContainer.replaceChildren();surplus.replaceChildren();
    const title=(id:string)=>nameCache?.get(id)??("Item #"+id);
    for(const step of plan.steps){
     const tr=el("tr"),td=el("td");
     td.append(itemLink(step.itemId,title(step.itemId)));
     if(step.manualBatch)td.append(el("small",pt?" · Batch manual":" · Manual batch"));
     tr.append(td);
     for(const value of [step.requested,step.output,step.totalBatches,step.operations,step.maxPerOperation])
      tr.append(el("td",fmt(value)));
     steps.append(tr);
    }
    for(const leaf of plan.leaves){
     const tr=el("tr"),td=el("td");td.append(itemLink(leaf.itemId,title(leaf.itemId)));
     tr.append(td,el("td",fmt(leaf.quantity)));
     const priceCell=el("td"),input=el("input") as HTMLInputElement;
     input.type="number";input.min="0";input.step="1";input.placeholder="0";input.value=prices[leaf.itemId]??"";
     input.setAttribute("aria-label",(pt?"Preço unitário ":"Unit price ")+title(leaf.itemId));
     input.addEventListener("change",()=>{
      prices[leaf.itemId]=input.value;
      try{localStorage.setItem(storedPriceKey,JSON.stringify(prices));}catch{}
      try{refreshCosts();}catch{status.textContent=pt?"Preço inválido.":"Invalid price.";}
     });
     priceCell.append(input);tr.append(priceCell);
     const totalCell=el("td","—");totalCell.dataset.costFor=leaf.itemId;
     tr.append(totalCell);leaves.append(tr);
    }
    refreshCosts();
    renderCraftTree();
    renderLeftovers();
    $("craft-summary-output").textContent=fmt(plan.rootOutput);
    $("craft-summary-batches").textContent=fmt(plan.totalBatches);
    $("craft-summary-operations").textContent=fmt(plan.totalOperations);
    $("craft-summary-materials").textContent=fmt(plan.leaves.length);
    note.textContent=plan.complete
      ?(pt?"Plano calculado a partir das receitas escolhidas.":"Plan calculated using the selected source recipes.")
      :(pt?"Plano parcial: verifique receitas e batches abaixo.":"Partial plan: review recipe and batch questions below.");
    for(const issue of plan.issues){
     const wrap=el("div"),heading=el("strong",title(issue.itemId)+" (#"+issue.itemId+")");
     wrap.className="craft-issue";wrap.append(heading);
     if(issue.kind==="choose-variant"){
      wrap.append(el("p",pt?"Selecione qual versão da receita utilizar:":"Choose the original recipe variant:"));
      const select=el("select") as HTMLSelectElement;
      const placeholder=el("option",pt?"Selecione uma receita":"Select a recipe") as HTMLOptionElement;
      placeholder.value="";select.append(placeholder);
      for(const [i,v] of activeGraph[issue.itemId].entries()){
       const option=el("option",(pt?"Receita ":"Recipe ")+(i+1)+" · #"+v.sourceRows.join(", #")) as HTMLOptionElement;
       option.value=String(i);select.append(option);
      }
      select.addEventListener("change",()=>{
       if(select.value!==""){choices[issue.itemId]=Number(select.value);redraw();}
      });
      wrap.append(select);
     }else if(issue.kind==="missing-batch"||issue.kind==="batch-over-limit"){
      wrap.append(el("p",pt
       ?"Tamanho de lote não confirmado ou maior que 10.000. Informe manualmente as unidades por batch (1 a 10.000)."
       :"Batch size missing or above 10,000. Supply units per batch manually (1–10,000)."));
      const input=el("input") as HTMLInputElement;
      input.type="number";input.min="1";input.max="10000";input.step="1";input.placeholder="Batch size";
      input.addEventListener("change",()=>{
       if(input.validity.valid&&Number(input.value)>0){
        batchOverrides[issue.itemId]=input.value;redraw();
       }
      });
      wrap.append(input);
     }
     issues.append(wrap);
    }
    result.hidden=false;
   }catch(error){
    status.textContent=(pt?"Não foi possível calcular: ":"Could not calculate: ")+
      (error instanceof Error?error.message:String(error));
    result.hidden=true;
   }
  }
  let nameCache:Map<string,string>|null=null;
  form.addEventListener("submit",event=>{
   event.preventDefault();
   const match=query.value.trim().match(/^(\d{1,13})$/);
   const id=selectedId||(match?match[1]:"");
   if(!id){status.textContent=pt?"Escolha um item da lista ou informe um ItemID.":"Choose an item from suggestions or enter an ItemID.";return;}
   const desired=amount.value;
   status.textContent=pt?"Carregando receitas e dependências…":"Loading recipe dependencies…";
   void (async()=>{
    try{
     nameCache=await getIndex();
     if(!nameCache.has(id))throw Error(pt?"ItemID não encontrado no catálogo.":"ItemID not found in catalog.");
     selectedId=id;activeGraph=await loadGraph(id);
     if(!activeGraph||Object.keys(activeGraph).length===0)throw Error("No recipe graph");
     status.textContent=pt?"Dados carregados.":"Source data loaded.";
     redraw();
    }catch(error){
     status.textContent=(pt?"Falha: ":"Error: ")+(error instanceof Error?error.message:String(error));
     result.hidden=true;
    }
   })();
  });
  const requested=new URL(location.href).searchParams.get("id");
  if(requested&&/^[1-9]\d{0,12}$/.test(requested)){
   query.value=requested;selectedId=requested;
  }
 }
</script>
<style>
 .craft-planner{width:min(var(--content-width),94%);margin:0 auto;padding:30px 0 80px}
 nav a{color:var(--color-accent)}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)}
 .eyebrow{color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.13em}
 .craft-planner>p{max-width:890px;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
 .craft-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,2fr) minmax(130px,1fr) auto;
   gap:14px;align-items:end;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);
   background:var(--color-surface);border-radius:6px}
 .field{position:relative;min-width:0}
 label{display:block;color:var(--color-gold-light);font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:8px}
 input,.craft-issue select,.craft-form button{width:100%;padding:11px;background:var(--color-background);
   color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:5px;font:inherit}
 .craft-form button{background:var(--color-accent);color:var(--color-on-accent);cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
 #craft-suggestions{position:absolute;z-index:10;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;
   left:0;right:0;max-height:240px;overflow:auto;background:var(--color-surface);
   border:1px solid var(--color-border)}
 #craft-suggestions:empty{display:none}
